sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Host client
    participant Part as Target participant
    participant API as POST /sessions/:code/curators
    participant SM as SessionManager.promote_curator
    participant DB as Supabase (sessions.curators)
    participant WS as websocket_manager.py

    H->>API: {socketId: Part's socket id}
    API->>SM: promote_curator(code, socketId)
    alt socketId already a curator
        SM->>SM: remove from curators list (demote)
    else not yet a curator
        SM->>SM: append to curators list (promote)
    end
    SM->>DB: update_curators(code, curators)
    SM-->>API: updated curators list
    API->>WS: curator:promoted {curators, socketId}
    WS->>H: broadcast
    WS->>Part: broadcast
    Note over Part: Part's client now unlocks curator-only UI\n(answer clusters, see host notes context)\nif its own socketId is in the curators list
